              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say *xīngqī* — **R1**, one lesson back, before it decays]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "有 日."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "each one aloud, with nothing said first — yǒu, rì",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: each one aloud, with nothing said first — *yǒu*, *rì*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "script",
          "title": "Script — eight strokes, then the moon",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "期 (qī)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Two pieces, left before right."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The left piece, eight strokes. A horizontal at the top. Two verticals down through it. Two short horizontals between them. A long horizontal across the foot. Then a left-falling stroke and a dot under it."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The moon, four strokes. A left-falling stroke down the left. A horizontal that turns down the right and hooks. Two short horizontals inside. It is the lower part of 有."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "8 + 4 = twelve."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "WRITE",
              "instruction": "期 (qī), all twelve, with the model in front of you",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU WRITE: 期, all twelve, with the model in front of you]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "COVER",
              "instruction": "write it again from memory, and count the pieces, not the strokes",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU COVER: write it again from memory, and count the pieces, not the strokes]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "How many pieces in 期 (qī)? (Two — eight strokes, then the moon.) What is under the long bar of the left piece? (A left-falling stroke and a dot.) How does the moon begin? (With a left-falling stroke.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Source: Hanzi Writer Data 期 (qī), pinned stroke paths and medians."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
